		{
			"format": "fullpage",
			"type": "contest",
			"headline": "Writing Contest",
			"text": [
				{
					"text": "A Message in a Bottle",
					"x": 50,
					"y": 50,
					"bold": true,
					"align": "center"
				},
				{
					"text": "Pirates are red\nMages are blue\nMarin, how do you do?\nHope those pirates are good,\nTheir smiles be worth their weight in gold\nShiny pieces of glass, the Islands' a blast\nIf you see a pirate, tell 'em I said hi\nSee you later,\nin Everbrook I hope",
					"x": 50,
					"y": 160
				},
				{
					"text": "-Submitted by Yolohombre",
					"x": 320,
					"y": 270
				},
				{
					"text": "I only appear once in the game, I am thrown away immediately, but recovered later to fulfill my only purpose. What am I?",
					"x": 50,
					"y": 330,
					"width": 505
				},
				{
					"text": "𝐀𝐧𝐬𝐰𝐞𝐫: ǝʇᴉɯɐuʎp",
					"x": 50,
					"y": 360
				},
				{
					"text": "-Submitted by Yolohombre",
					"x": 320,
					"y": 390
				},
				{
					"text": "An Ent walks into a bar. The bartender looks at him and says, \"Why the log face?\"",
					"x": 50,
					"y": 450
				},
				{
					"text": "-Submitted by 0range",
					"x": 330,
					"y": 490
				},
				{
					"text": "Adoration of Alien",
					"x": 650,
					"y": -20,
					"align": "center",
					"bold": true
				},
				{
					"text": "Fair beauty, your green pallor complements the rock so gently\nEyes, big, black, and gorgeous\nI could get lost in their grey eternity\nYour pickaxe, coveted by all\nBut your heart, I wish, will be mine alone\n\nFrom the heavens you fell, like an angel\nYour elegance runs as deep as space\nSure as meteors fall, I yearn\nAnd hope you will come back to me, \nbut regardless\nI shall see you again in the stars my love",
					"x": 650,
					"y": 130,
					"width": 460
				},
				{
					"text": "-Submitted By taoteching",
					"x": 900,
					"y": 285
				},
				{
					"text": "“Can I borrow your possessed hunting mask for the collection log?”\n“Sure.”\n“Thanks.”\n*Logs out with your possessed hunting mask.*",
					"x": 650,
					"y": 370,
					"width": 450
				},
				{
					"text": "-Submitted by Gin",
					"x": 950,
					"y": 450
				}
			]
		},
